WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.333 --> 00:00:16.718
Open app from the correct client profile.

2
00:00:16.718 --> 00:00:26.616
Open the current workout before tracking.

3
00:00:26.616 --> 00:00:34.881
Record the real reps and weight for each set.

4
00:00:34.881 --> 00:00:41.898
Use previous results as context, not a target.

5
00:00:41.898 --> 00:00:49.913
Change only what the client actually completed.

6
00:00:49.913 --> 00:00:56.922
Use notes for useful workout context.

7
00:00:56.922 --> 00:01:03.941
Review the workout before saving.

8
00:01:03.941 --> 00:01:10.948
Finish with the client's honest rating.

9
00:01:10.948 --> 00:01:22.114
Return to trainer mode after the demo.

10
00:01:22.114 --> 00:01:28.817
Never invent missing workout data.

